Silicon Labs EmberZNet / EZSP.
The Zigbee radio (EFR32MG24) runs Silicon Labs EmberZNet; its firmware
is in the mg24/ submodule (bitengine-hub-zigbee-ncp), which has its own
licensing. No Silicon Labs source code is included in this repository.
The Direct profile's Zigbee host (components/zhub/) implements the ASH
and EZSP host protocols; its ASH state machine (zh_ash_core.c) follows
the structure of the Silicon Labs host reference implementation
(ash-host.c) for reviewability, without copying its code.
components/zhub/UPSTREAM.md lists the Silicon Labs SDK files used as
references and for the optional interoperability tests, which build
against a locally installed Simplicity SDK and are not distributed here.
